{"product_id":"gid://shopify/Product/7392885637278","title":"Sanrio  Cinnamoroll Sticky Note (Calm Color)","old_description":"\n                               \u003ch3\u003e Details: \u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n                               \u003cli\u003e Brand: Sanrio\u003c/li\u003e\n                               \n\n                                \u003cli\u003e Size: 11.5×11.0×0.4cm\u003c/li\u003e\n                               \u003c/ul\u003e\n                   ","new_description":"\u003cdiv class=\"product-accordion-item\" data-accordion\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-header\" data-accordion-trigger\u003e \u003ch3\u003eDescription\u003c/h3\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-content\"\u003e \u003cp\u003eThe Sanrio Cinnamoroll Sticky Note in Calm Color is a charming and practical addition to your stationery collection. Featuring the beloved Cinnamoroll character, these sticky notes bring a touch of cuteness to your desk while helping you stay organized. Their soothing pastel tones make them perfect for both home and office use, adding a gentle pop of color without overwhelming your workspace.\u003c/p\u003e \u003cp\u003eDesigned with convenience in mind, the Sanrio Cinnamoroll Sticky Note pads are easy to use for jotting down reminders, messages, or to-do lists. Their compact size ensures they fit neatly into planners, notebooks, or your bag, making it simple to carry them wherever you go. Whether for personal notes or sharing quick messages, this sticky note set combines functionality with delightful design.\u003c/p\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"product-accordion-item\" data-accordion\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-header\" data-accordion-trigger\u003e \u003ch3\u003eDetails\u003c/h3\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-content\"\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e• Product Material:\u003c/strong\u003e Paper\u003c/p\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e• Manufacturer:\u003c/strong\u003e Sanrio\u003c/p\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"product-accordion-item\" data-accordion\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-header\" data-accordion-trigger\u003e \u003ch3\u003eFeatures\u003c/h3\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-content\"\u003e \u003cul\u003e \u003cli\u003eFeatures the popular Cinnamoroll character for a fun and cute design\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003eCalm color palette suitable for any setting, including home and office\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003eCompact size of 11.5×11.0×0.4cm fits easily on desks or in planners\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003eIdeal for quick notes, reminders, and messages to keep you organized\u003c/li\u003e \u003c/ul\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"product-accordion-item\" data-accordion\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-header\" data-accordion-trigger\u003e \u003ch3\u003eHow to use\u003c/h3\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-content\"\u003e \u003cp\u003ePeel off individual sticky notes as needed and place them on any clean, flat surface such as notebooks, desks, or walls. Use them to jot down reminders, messages, or quick notes throughout your day. Keep the sticky note pad in a dry area to maintain adhesive quality and prevent damage.\u003c/p\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"product-accordion-item\" data-accordion\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-header\" data-accordion-trigger\u003e \u003ch3\u003eCare instructions\u003c/h3\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-content\"\u003e \u003cp\u003eStore the sticky note pad in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight to prevent fading and adhesive deterioration. Avoid exposure to moisture and extreme temperatures to maintain the stickiness and paper quality. Keep the pad flat to prevent curling or bending of the notes.\u003c/p\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003c/div\u003e","category":"general","has_sufficient_data":true,"status":"success","error_mess